  "description": "The Hemingway D9 is a light and speedy bike that is both adaptable and compact to meet the needs of the city as well as the rural environment. With DELTECH, transform the way you travel with quick folding and the freedom to carry and store your bike the way you want.\n\nPowered by DAHON-V\n\nFeaturing DELTECH—key patents of DAHON-V technology—it offers superior frame rigidity for outstanding speed and safety. This powerful synergy enhances pedaling efficiency, making even uphill rides a breeze.\n\nEfficient Power Transfer\n\nThis high-performance crank is designed to enhance your ride, providing smooth and effective energy transfer for all your cycling adventures.\n\nSmooth Shifts, Every Time\n\nNavigate your ride with confidence using the DAHON custom 9-speed trigger shifter, engineered for intuitive operation and smooth gear shifts.\n\nHemingway: A Journey of Adventure\n\nInspired by the legendary writer, the Hemingway bike captures the spirit of exploration. Its sleek design and reliable performance make it the perfect companion for discovering new paths and experiences.\n\nTravel Safely with Ease\n\nSecure your bike effortlessly with the handlepost safety lock. Its intuitive design ensures your bike remains safely folded and ready for transport, providing peace of mind on the go.\n\nClassic K-Frame Design\n\nFeaturing a distinctive K-Frame design, this bike maximizes performance and maneuverability, making it perfect for urban riding and beyond.",
